  "title": "Implement the selected MOVE24472 as a literal fixed-tape program with paid transactional composition",
  "body": "## Result\nOne fixed 31-tape graph joins all six factors of selected MOVE24472, with a single public commit, successful restoration, and complete O(fV+E) time and O(V+E) added history. This is a supplied-entry direct leaf implementation; all five global assumptions and selected kappa are unchanged.\n\n## Evidence and scope\nPinned base e54523517d0f03e58352e647c403a5af3e525a57; predecessor #7426, #7427, #7428, #7429, #7430. Exact source binding, normal/optimized regression, four mutations, instruction relocation review and a separate exact-integer forward oracle pass. Reproduce with bind_source.py, verify.py and review/check_join.py in the package. Caller packing, numerical entry, faster recursion and failure cleanup remain open.\n\nCredit: @CubeJerry and cited predecessors; substantial OpenAI Codex assistance.\n\n[Full proof, source pins, reproduction results and proposed description](https://github.com/CubeJerry/integer-mult-bounds/blob/3a27ab1d302d13b1ce52411f8a174e7a32baab77/research/literal-selected-move-join/PR-DESCRIPTION.md)\n",
